  texts:
  - "Even the vault\u2019s got a couch? Now that\u2019s luxury!"
  - Cash and comfort? This vault knows how to spoil us!
  - A couch in the vault? I could nap on my fortune!
  - "This vault\u2019s comfier than my apartment!"
